  "description": "ILogger provider that ships error logs to the Sppro Api Logger service. Crash-safe: never throws to the host, even if the formatter, options, or shipper fail — and from 0.3.1, neither does any other registered logging provider. From 0.4.0 ships a full diagnostic surface (event hooks, diagnostic log file, FlushAsync, synchronous mode, status snapshot, boot-time auth check, options validation). Multi-targets net48, net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
